          "quote": "最近肝功能化验单、乙肝病毒那张、肺部CT报告、写“肝炎/肺结核”的病历页、还有老人现在吃的药盒"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00141",
          "explanation": "Doctor advises against pre-draws and tells caregiver to let the transplant clinic order, transforming the plan into a low-burden, wait-and-observe approach.",
