      "explanation": "The doctor addressed the family's infection fear by recommending non-discriminatory measures (public chopsticks, no isolation, ventilation), protected patient privacy by not requiring full disclosure, and obtained a detailed teach-back from the caregiver in lite_evt_00156. No minor error.",
